Additionally, Isaac Robinson-Smith, [[Debra Wilson]], and [[Alison Haislip]] voice the survivors Rick, Denise, and Sandra, respectively. Other actors in minor voice roles include [[Dave Boat]], Terri Douglas, [[Robin Atkin Downes]], [[Matthew Yang King]], Andrew Morgado, [[Ashley Peldon]], [[Michael Ralph]], [[Fred Tatasciore]], Mike Vaughn, and [[Matthew Wood (sound editor)|Matthew Wood]].<ref name="CastCBC" />

Characters making non-speaking appearances include survivors [[Ikaris (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Ikaris]],<ref name="CaptainMarvelIkaris" /><!-- End 101 --> [[Death Dealer (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Death Dealer]],<ref name="SDCC2022CBR" /><!-- End 102 --> [[T'Challa (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|T'Challa / Black Panther]],<ref name="TrailerBeebom" /> [[Rocket (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Rocket Raccoon]], [[Groot (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Groot]],<ref name="EasterEggs" /> and [[Bruce Banner (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Bruce Banner / Infinity Hulk]],<ref name="EndingExplained" /><!-- End 103 --> as well as the zombies of [[Clint Barton (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Clint Barton / Hawkeye]], [[Steve Rogers (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Steve Rogers / Captain America]], [[Emil Blonsky (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Emil Blonsky / Abomination]], [[Ava Starr|Ava Starr / Ghost]], [[Carol Danvers (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Carol Danvers / Captain Marvel]],<ref name="SDCC2022CBR" /><!-- End 101 --> [[Namor (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Namor]],<!-- End 102 --> [[Thanos (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Thanos]],<!-- End 103 --> [[Hank Pym (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Hank Pym / Ant-Man]], [[Janet van Dyne (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Janet van Dyne / Wasp]],<ref name="TrailerIndiatimes" /> and [[Hope van Dyne|Hope van Dyne / Wasp]].<ref name="Ep4Recap" /><!-- End 104 --> The character [[Watcher (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Uatu / Watcher]] also makes a non-speaking [[cameo appearance]].<ref name="EasterEggs" />

